# sapintegrationsuite_custom_tag_configuration (Data Source)

Reads every custom tag and its permitted values. Takes no arguments: a tenant has exactly one
configuration. Use it to read the tags without owning them, or to prepare an import of
[`sapintegrationsuite_custom_tag_configuration`](../resources/custom_tag_configuration.md).

**Status:** partial, like the resource (SAP offers no delete).

What SAP returns for a tenant that never had a custom tag configuration has not been tested.

